sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant EV as ExpertsView
    participant CML as CardMarketLayout
    participant EC as EntityCard
    participant UDT as useDomainTags
    participant Store as chatStore
    participant CV as ChatView
    participant OP as OutputPanel
    participant Detail as ExpertDetail | TeamDetail

    %% 1. 进入市场页面
    User->>EV: 路由 /experts
    EV->>CML: 渲染 CardMarketLayout<br/>props: { entities: MOCK_EXPERTS, title: '专家市场', entityType: 'expert' }
    CML->>UDT: sortedDomains(allDomainTags)
    UDT-->>CML: 按频度排序的领域标签列表
    CML->>CML: 渲染 4×5 网格 + 精选推荐横滚

    %% 2. 搜索 & 筛选
    User->>CML: 在搜索框输入 "Python"
    CML->>CML: 300ms 防抖 → filteredEntities computed
    CML-->>User: 网格更新为匹配结果

    User->>CML: 点击领域标签 "前端"
    CML->>UDT: recordDomainClick('前端')
    UDT->>UDT: localStorage 写入 km-domain-freq
    CML-->>User: "前端" 标签移至第二位，网格按 domain 筛选

    %% 3. 点击卡片 → 详情
    User->>EC: 点击某张专家卡片
    EC->>CML: emit('select', entity)
    CML->>EV: emit('select', entity)
    EV->>Store: openDetail({ type: 'expert', id: entity.id })
    Store->>Store: detailEntity = { type: 'expert', id: entity.id }
    Store->>Store: rightPanelMode = 'detail'
    Store->>CV: rightPanelMode change

    %% 4. 右栏展开
    CV->>CV: 检测 rightPanelMode='detail'
    CV->>OP: 展开右栏（width: 0 → 420px, transition）
    OP->>OP: 判断 detailEntity.type = 'expert'
    OP->>Detail: 渲染 ExpertDetail，props: { entity }
    Detail-->>User: 专家详情：名称/专长/场景/Prompts/标签

    %% 5a. 召唤专家
    User->>Detail: 点击右上角 "召唤" 按钮
    Detail->>Store: createSessionWithConfig({ agentRole: expert.id, ...defaults })
    Store->>Store: highlightedSessionId = session.id
    Store->>Store: rightPanelMode = 'hidden'
    Store->>Store: closeDetail()
    Store->>CV: rightPanelMode='hidden'
    CV->>OP: 右栏收起（width: 0）
    Store-->>User: 左栏高亮新会话 + 主栏打开对话

    %% 5b. 查看成员详情（仅 TeamDetail）
    alt 实体类型是 ExpertTeam
        User->>Detail: 点击成员卡片
        Detail->>Detail: selectedMember = member
        Detail-->>User: NModal 弹窗：成员纯详情（名称+专长+场景，无召唤按钮）
    end
